  "description": "\nThinkGeo GIS Server targets .NET 8 (ASP.NET Core) and helps you host GIS services for your applications. It provides ready-to-use endpoints for common OGC services and integrates with ThinkGeo Core layers and styles.\n\nVector: MVT, GeoJSON, WFS\nRaster: WMS, WMTS, XYZ\n\nSupported platforms: Windows, Linux\n\nOther ThinkGeo Products based on .NET:\nThinkGeo.UI.Maui\nThinkGeo.UI.Android\nThinkGeo.UI.iOS\nThinkGeo.UI.Blazor\nThinkGeo.UI.Wpf\nThinkGeo.UI.WinForms\nThinkGeo.GisServer\n  ",
